---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';

const htmlContent = `
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated: October 11, 2026</strong></p>

  <div class="legal-summary" style="background: var(--bg-surface); padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); margin: 2rem 0; border-radius: var(--radius-xs);">
    <strong style="color:var(--accent-sky);">Plain-Language Summary:</strong> This website is completely static. I do not set any tracking, advertising, or analytics cookies. A cookie banner is unnecessary because there are zero trackers to opt out of.
  </div>
  
  <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your computer or mobile device when visiting a website. They are typically used to maintain sessions, track browsing across domains, or store state.</p>

  <h2>2. How I Use Cookies</h2>
  <p><strong>I do not use them.</strong> This portfolio is built using Astro as a pre-rendered static site. It does not employ Google Analytics, Meta Pixels, session trackers, or third-party advertising cookies.</p>

  <h2>3. Controlling Cookies</h2>
  <p>Because zero cookies are set, no cookie management panel is required. You can manage and clear cookies across the web using standard browser preferences.</p>

  <h2>4. Version History</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>v1.1 (Oct 2026):</strong> Hardened zero-tracking baseline and updated contact desk.</li>
    <li><strong>v1.0 (Sep 2026):</strong> Initial cookie policy published. Verified zero-cookie footprint.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>For data or legal enquiries, contact: <a href="mailto:contact@khandal.tech">contact@khandal.tech</a></p>
`;
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  tag="Legal"
  meta="Legal · Cookie Policy"
  backHref="/"
  backLabel="Home"
  htmlContent={htmlContent}
/>
